# Action buttons

Primary CTAs use **Nuxt UI** `UButton` with `size="lg"` and `block` (see my-lara-stack Login / Demo pages).

## Use `AppActionButton`

Thin wrapper for the same defaults:

```vue
<AppActionButton @click="onSubmit">Continue</AppActionButton>
```

- [`app/components/AppActionButton.vue`](app/components/AppActionButton.vue)
- Props: `disabled`, `loading`, `type`, `block` (default `true`), `href`, `to`

## Secondary / tertiary

- **Secondary:** `variant="outline"` `size="lg"`
- **Tertiary / skip:** `variant="link"` or `variant="ghost"`
- **Destructive:** `color="error"` `variant="soft"`

## Do not

Use one-off black `#111111` CTA styling unless reintroducing a separate auth brand — my-lara-stack uses default primary `UButton`.
